#: mason/phenotypes/submission_guide.mas:70
msgctxt "phenotype.if_you_have_multiple_repeats_the_loading_software_will_automatically"
msgid "If you have multiple repeats, the loading software will automatically increment the repeat number each time it sees a row of data for a plot or accession. If you provide repeat number (or fruit/plant/leaf number etc.) it will be used instead."
