msgid "Data columns must be in one of these two orders for uploading Subplot phenotypes: 1) 'subplot_name', 'plot_name', 'accession_name' or 'family_name' or 'cross_unique_id', 'plot_number', 'block_number', 'is_a_control', 'rep_number', 'planting_date', 'harvest_date', 'trial_name' OR 2) 'plant_name', 'subplot_name', 'plot_name', 'accession_name' or 'family_name' or 'cross_unique_id', 'plot_number', 'block_number', 'is_a_control', 'rep_number', 'planting_date', 'harvest_date', 'trial_name'. Make sure to select the correct data level. It may help to recreate your spreadsheet from the website."
